r photos, dead Flickr &lt;code&gt;farmN&lt;/code&gt; subdomains, and defunct feed-syndication infrastructure. Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m in the process of scanning in some of my Dad&amp;rsquo;s old slides and I came across a selection he took from his visit to Le Mans in 1968, two years before I was born.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s what I&amp;rsquo;ve scanned so far, can&amp;rsquo;t wait to see what else is in the slide box labeled &amp;ldquo;Le Mans Sept 1968&amp;rdquo;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4347151880/" title="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0081 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4005/4347151880_063c65ba40.jpg" width="500" height="327" alt="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0081" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4346406855/" title="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0082 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2725/4346406855_1ebd1895db.jpg" width="500" height="324" alt="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0082" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4347153360/" title="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0084 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4032/4347153360_76c63f3446.jpg" width="500" height="306" alt="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0084" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4347152942/" title="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0083 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2686/4347152942_45b970be07.jpg" width="500" height="324" alt="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0083" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4346408379/" title="Le Mans 1968 IMG_0085 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4032/4346408379_c228038445.jpg" width="500" height="324" a